      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MUSTANG ETHICS (2) was midfield throughout and finished there last time when 4th (30.05) at Gosford. Can make amends. BILLY RAY'S GIRL (1) finished in the minors last start over the 520m at this track but ran a handy 29.77 last start. Should be in this for a long way. RISE UP NISMO (7) finished fifth last time but the start prior broke the clock when winning over 450m at Maitland, taking a NG in a brilliant 24.96. Smart winner two back and looks a key chance on that form. MEPUNGA ZIRCON (6) recorded the slickest time on the program at his latest win. Hard to beat again.",
